    <string name="dictionary_format_title">Dictionary format</string>
    <string name="dictionary_format_text">Import dictionaries in Yomitan format: a <b>.zip</b> file (not unpacked) with <b>index.json</b> and <b>term_bank_N.json</b> or <b>kanji_bank_N.json</b> files. Frequency and pitch-accent dictionaries are not supported.\n\nFind dictionaries on the Yomitan wiki, for example Jitendex, JMdict, JMnedict, KANJIDIC and Wiktionary.\n\nWords are looked up in one dictionary at a time. Kanji details always come from the built-in dictionary.</string>
